BTS 21 · #81","image":"/img/scene-clips/7346.webp","imageBytes":23200,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7346.mp4","videoBytes":148742,"duration":4.041667},"f6df67e9870c":{"text":"Are there special decorations?","id":"f6df67e9870c","source":"BTS 21 · #61","image":"/img/scene-clips/7374.webp","imageBytes":11534,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7374.mp4","videoBytes":116607,"duration":4.041667},"3cccf11f2c02":{"text":"Do you give gifts on birthdays?","id":"3cccf11f2c02","source":"BTS 21 · #14","image":"/img/scene-clips/7387.webp","imageBytes":22866,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7387.mp4","videoBytes":142785,"duration":4.041667},"bec0835d69e2":{"text":"We eat dumplings and moon cakes.","id":"bec0835d69e2","source":"BTS 21 · #60","image":"/img/scene-clips/7394.webp","imageBytes":17234,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7394.mp4","videoBytes":99729,"duration":4.041667},"8196b580f072":{"text":"It celebrates the birth of a nation.","id":"8196b580f072","source":"BTS 21 · #34","image":"/img/scene-clips/7482.webp","imageBytes":22824,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7482.mp4","videoBytes":157866,"duration":4.041667},"afc318aadede":{"text":"Eid is an important Islamic holiday.","id":"afc318aadede","source":"BTS 21 · #49","image":"/img/scene-clips/7486.webp","imageBytes":39036,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7486.mp4","videoBytes":246059,"duration":4.041667},"a0fac33d88da":{"text":"How long are your holiday vacations?","id":"a0fac33d88da","source":"BTS 21 · #71","image":"/img/scene-clips/7497.webp","imageBytes":17418,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7497.mp4","videoBytes":144308,"duration":4.041667}},"examples":["What is your favorite holiday memory?","Easter is a Christian holiday celebrating the resurrection.","We always go caroling on Christmas Eve.","We meet our relatives and have a big dinner.","Do you decorate your house for the holidays?","Yes, we put up a Christmas tree.","I remember decorating the tree with my family.","What holidays does your country celebrate?","We celebrate New Year's Day and Chuseok.","On Halloween, children wear costumes.","They go trick-or-treating in the neighborhood.","Thanksgiving is a time to be grateful.","What are you thankful for?","Yes, I always give presents to my friends.","Do you give gifts on birthdays?","Happy holidays! Have a wonderful time!","How do you celebrate the New Year?","We watch fireworks at midnight.","Do you attend any festivals?","Yes, I love going to the lantern festival.","What is Valentine's Day?","It is a day to celebrate love and friendship.","Do you send cards on Valentine's Day?","What about Mother's Day?","We give gifts and flowers to our mothers.","Father's Day is when we celebrate our dads.","We usually have a special meal together.","Are there special decorations?","Yes, we make paper snowflakes together.","Do you dye eggs at Easter?","Yes, we have an Easter egg hunt.","Do you go to parades on Independence Day?","It celebrates the birth of a nation.","Yes, there are fireworks and celebrations.","It is a Jewish holiday celebrated for eight days.","Christmas is celebrated by many people worldwide.","It is a time for family and giving.","Do you hang stockings by the fireplace?","Yes, and we fill them with small gifts.","What about Hanukkah?","Do you light candles during Hanukkah?","Yes, we light one candle each night.","What is Diwali?","It is the festival of lights in India.","Yes, lamps symbolize the victory of good.","Eid is an important Islamic holiday.","It marks the end of Ramadan.","What is Lunar New Year?","It is celebrated in many Asian countries.","Yes, new clothes bring good luck.","What gifts do you exchange?","We give red envelopes with money inside.","Do you clean your house before holidays?","Yes, cleaning symbolizes a fresh start.","Turkey is the traditional Thanksgiving dish.","What traditional foods do you eat?","We eat dumplings and moon cakes.","Yes, we use red lanterns and banners.","It is a holiday to give thanks for the harvest.","What traditional food is served?","What else do you serve?","We serve stuffing, cranberry sauce, and pie.","Do you travel for the holidays?","Yes, I visit my relatives in another city.","How long are your holiday vacations?","Usually about two weeks.","Do you make holiday decorations by hand?","Red, green, and gold are traditional colors.","Yes, we sing carols together as a family.","Do you sing holiday songs?","What is a holiday tradition?","It is something you do the same way every year.","What traditions does your family have?","Do you attend religious services for holidays?","Yes, we go to church on Christmas and Easter.","Do you go shopping on Boxing Day?","Yes, there are big sales and discounts.","What about Summer solstice?","It is the longest day of the year.","What festivals happen in summer?","There are many outdoor concerts and fairs.","Yes, I love the local community festivals.","What about Winter solstice?","It is the shortest day of the year.","Yes, some cultures have special festivals."]}
